{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6ee192e44eee40769034593fa22a4f487cd3d318b126aeda16ad404a22b38192", "ja": "風花とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与风花出门外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6b2875b5d901875587cf4a2bfae47aafaeeb98d8e1cd15f0b9ef6f0c950e91fa", "ja": "（鳥取で、風花に可愛い仕事が来た！　\nこれはきっと喜ぶんじゃないかな……）", "zh": "（在鸟取，风花接到了可爱的工作！\n她一定会很开心吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7f286c53b0e3358de5936943deac37210b63f1e17e1a51dc86668c77504fc077", "ja": "えーっと。今日は、ハイキングコースを\n紹介すればいいんですよね？　衣装って……。", "zh": "呃……今天是要介绍徒步路线，对吧？那服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "57888c56a35e3253bcf00db991fc4f02167284d999427c19cc24d412aadfefd4", "ja": "ああ、これだ。\n因幡の白兎をイメージしてるんだそうだ。", "zh": "啊，就是这个。据说是以因幡的白兔为灵感设计的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "90e07feaf31e6c90e035eb1e354bbc66c083aea0bb77d897086a0045198dd5a0", "ja": "わあ……♪　ふわふわで、なんだかパジャマみたい。\nとってもカワイイし、露出度も高くないし……。", "zh": "哇……♪ 毛茸茸的，感觉有点像睡衣。\n非常可爱，而且露肤度也不高……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1773167db50f2c08a95f1b454d91d973b301e45f6044ca4bd67ed7cd82dea75e", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん！\n……あっ、でも……。", "zh": "非常感谢您，{$P$}先生！\n……啊，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fcbb8fc07b4efe2acb163426365ad4981383de74f8579a29f04be4bdc01b1ffe", "ja": "因幡の白兎のお話って、ウサギはワニをだました\n仕返しに、皮を剥がれちゃうんですよね……？", "zh": "因幡白兔的故事里，兔子因为骗了鳄鱼\n遭到报复，结果被剥了皮对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c835c2f947d97010cb2a6ede51af83dbaffe79fbe5d2a053aa5e8352f29e2608", "ja": "いや、ワニは出てこないから大丈夫だ。\n安心して撮影に挑んでくれ！", "zh": "不，鳄鱼不会登场的，别担心。\n放心去迎接拍摄吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f8736fa22ad1a9fd9d3808142c9e4d3a8b53862f15023d5e72f2b3d706ed29d6", "ja": "そうなんですか？　よかった……。\n私、がんばりますね♪", "zh": "是这样吗？那太好了……我会加油的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_041fuk01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "390aebdd5ddb69937e0b34e0169771b67a8cbd8ff11109b2b3d27a31d31587f6", "ja": "（撮影中、風花はずっと楽しそうにしていた。\n可愛い仕事でよかったな、風花！）", "zh": "（拍摄期间，风花一直都很开心。能接到这么可爱的工作真是太好了，风花！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
